Request body
In the request body, supply a JSON representation of the connectedOrganization object.
You can specify the following properties when creating a connectedOrganization.
| Property |
Type |
Description |
| displayName |
String |
The connected organization name. |
| description |
String |
The connected organization description. |
| identitySources |
identitySource collection |
A collection with one element, the initial identity source in this connected organization. |
| state |
connectedOrganizationState |
The state of a connected organization defines whether assignment policies with requestor scope type AllConfiguredConnectedOrganizationSubjects are applicable or not. The possible values are: configured , proposed . |
